# ch5-secret-guard allowlist — paths the plaintext-secret guard may skip.
# gitignore-style globs, one per line, repo-relative. `#` comments.
#
# Every entry below was verified on 2026-08-11 against the committed blob on
# every ref, not against the working tree. Adding a path here makes the guard
# blind to it forever: scope entries to the exact file, never a directory, and
# re-verify before widening one.

# Upstream's documented self-hosting example. Both PL_*_PASSWORD values are the
